                                                "sense_id": "d448a2ce-7e1f-3060-b8c4-40273a646acb",
                                                "text": "Although the cresteds were the least numerous of the trio, they were certainly not uncommon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a9c8cb2-8c8d-48c6-be85-6938dd1a93d6",
                                                "sense_id": "d448a2ce-7e1f-3060-b8c4-40273a646acb",
                                                "text": "Fourth, impure cresteds (with one of each alleles) will produce the crests on the heads of live birds, and it is these birds which are exhibited as Balis or Crested Ducks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
